CCTPBridgeModule_GetDomainConfig
├── when domain is not configured
│   └── it should return a config with isValid false
└── given domain is configured
    ├── it should return isValid true
    ├── it should return the correct mintRecipient
    ├── it should return the correct destinationCaller
    ├── it should return the correct maxFee
    ├── it should return the correct minFinalityThreshold
    └── it should return the correct hookData
